@baseURL = http://localhost:3000
@id_anexo = 1

### Listar anexos
GET {{baseURL}}/attachments
Accept: application/json

### Criar anexo válido (PDF)
POST {{baseURL}}/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=TesteUpload

--TesteUpload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_compromisso"

1
--TesteUpload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample.pdf
--TesteUpload--

### Criar anexo sem arquivo (erro esperado)
POST {{baseURL}}/attachments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_compromisso": 1
}

### Criar anexo com tipo inválido (erro esperado)
POST {{baseURL}}/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=TesteUpload

--TesteUpload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_compromisso"

1
--TesteUpload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./fixtures/sample.txt
--TesteUpload--

### Atualizar anexo existente
PUT {{baseURL}}/attachments/{{id_anexo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome_original": "arquivo-atualizado.pdf",
  "nome_arquivo": "arquivo-atualizado.pdf",
  "mime_type": "application/pdf",
  "tamanho_bytes": 2000,
  "caminho": "uploads/attachments/arquivo-atualizado.pdf",
  "id_compromisso": 1
}

### Deletar anexo existente
DELETE {{baseURL}}/attachments/{{id_anexo}}
Accept: application/json
